                "description": "Beaded Egg Knob with Beaded Rose Fusion 10-B6 - Made out of solid brass, the quality Fusion Hardware's Beaded Egg Knob and matching rose is backed by a lifetime warranty. There are few door knobs that look as alluring and elegant as The Beaded Round Rose with Beaded Egg Knob does; and the regal appearance is only heightened by the 3 available finishes--all of them beautiful. It is available in either a 2-3/8 inch or a 2-3/4 inch backset; and will adjust to door thicknesses from 1-1/4 inches to 2 inches.\r\n",
